UPT-07 legacy-DI estimator parity alternate (unused)
===================================================

Archived 2026-08-04 before restoring the 12:35 unified/PT-oriented temporal
estimator. This is intentionally not compiled or exposed as a runtime CVar.
It preserves the exact experimental delta that made primary-direct temporal
use the legacy clean-DI support-count BASIC normalization and relative history
length clamp.

To recreate the alternate, add a runtime policy bit and apply this shader delta
to Upt07MergeTemporal:

--- neo/shaders/slang_upt07/upt07_temporal_reservoir.slang
+++ neo/shaders/slang_upt07/upt07_temporal_reservoir.slang
@@
-    const uint historyM = min(history.logical.effectiveM, maximumHistoryM);
+    const uint currentMForLimit = max(current.logical.effectiveM, 1u);
+    const uint directHistoryLimit = maximumHistoryM
+            > 0xffffffffu / currentMForLimit
+        ? 0xffffffffu : maximumHistoryM * currentMForLimit;
+    const uint historyM = min(
+        history.logical.effectiveM,
+        directDiParity != 0u ? directHistoryLimit : maximumHistoryM);
@@
-    const float finalizedMeanWeight = outputSelected
-            && isfinite(selectedSourceTarget) && selectedSourceTarget > 0.0f
-            && isfinite(targetWeightedDenominator)
-            && targetWeightedDenominator > 0.0f
-        ? totalMass * selectedSourceTarget / targetWeightedDenominator
-        : 0.0f;
+    const uint supportCount =
+        (selectedTargetAtCurrent > 0.0f
+            ? current.logical.effectiveM : 0u)
+        + (selectedTargetAtHistory > 0.0f ? historyM : 0u);
+    const float finalizedMeanWeight = outputSelected
+            && (directDiParity != 0u
+                ? supportCount > 0u
+                : (isfinite(selectedSourceTarget)
+                    && selectedSourceTarget > 0.0f
+                    && isfinite(targetWeightedDenominator)
+                    && targetWeightedDenominator > 0.0f))
+        ? (directDiParity != 0u
+            ? totalMass / float(supportCount)
+            : totalMass * selectedSourceTarget / targetWeightedDenominator)
+        : 0.0f;

The archived host switch was:

    r_pathTracingUnifiedPtTemporalDirectDiParity 0/1

It used geometryAvailabilityFlags bit 30 and passed directDiParity as the final
Upt07MergeTemporal argument. Do not re-enable this in the active unified path
without separately deciding whether the reservoir is a direct-DI reservoir or
a combined DI/GI/PT reservoir; the two estimators have different ownership.
